# Application builds need only the Rust workspace and embedded migrations.
# Keep local cloud credentials, Terraform state and tooling out of BuildKit.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**

**/target/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.local
crates/frontend/dist/pkg/*.wasm
crates/frontend/dist/pkg/exchange_frontend*
